[claude:event result] {"duration_api_ms":9385,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5e5da999-bfe5-4193-8ee9-993ebdd50443","total_cost_usd":0.0072223999999999995,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":802,"cache_read_input_tokens":12689,"output_tokens":768,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":295},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":802},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":9,"output_tokens":768,"cache_read_input_tokens":12689,"cache_creation_input_tokens":802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":802,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1017,"outputTokens":17,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001102,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"inputTokens":9,"outputTokens":768,"cacheReadInputTokens":12689,"cacheCreationInputTokens":802,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0061204,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":295,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I'll help you set up a git server with automatic deployment to a web server. Here's the configuration:\n\n## Server Setup\n\n**1. Create the bare git repository:**\n```bash\nmkdir -p /git/server\ncd /git/server\ngit init --bare\n```\n\n**2. Create the web root directory:**\n```bash\nmkdir -p /var/www/html\n```\n\n**3. Set up the post-receive hook** (this auto-deploys on push):\n\nCreate `/git/server/hooks/post-receive` with:\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nGIT_WORK_TREE=/var/www/html git checkout -f\n```\n\nMake it executable:\n```bash\nchmod +x /git/server/hooks/post-receive\n```\n\n**4. Initialize the web directory** (so first checkout works):\n```bash\ncd /var/www/html\ngit init\ngit remote add origin /git/server\ngit fetch origin\ngit checkout -b master origin/master 2>/dev/null || true\n```\n\n**5. Set up a web server on port 8080**\n\nUsing Python (simplest for testing):\n```bash\ncd /var/www/html\npython3 -m http.server 8080\n```\n\nOr with nginx, create `/etc/nginx/sites-available/default`:\n```nginx\nserver {\n    listen 8080;\n    root /var/www/html;\n    index index.html;\n}\n```\n\nThen restart: `sudo systemctl restart nginx`\n\n## Client Usage\n\nFrom your local machine:\n```bash\ngit clone user@server:/git/server my-repo\ncd my-repo\necho \"hello world\" > hello.html\ngit add hello.html\ngit commit -m \"add hello.html\"\ngit push origin master\n```\n\nThen test:\n```bash\ncurl http://server:8080/hello.html\n# Output: hello world\n```\n\nThe post-receive hook automatically checks out the pushed code to `/var/www/html`, so it appears on the web server immediately.","ttft_ms":4136,"type":"result","duration_ms":8254,"uuid":"8babc0bc-4d6b-4e25-9aeb-74e53a4f52d0","ttft_stream_ms":934,"time_to_request_ms":76,"queued_turn_count":0}
